{"availability":"available","full":"coffeetocoffee/barefoot-css","name":"barefoot-css","description":"Meet Barefoot CSS, the framework that kicked off its boots. No 200KB baggage, no Sass, no build step. Plain HTML styles itself from a handful of variables, and native elements do the work: dropdowns, dialogs, even tooltips, all accessible out of the box. The whole framework is 3.8KB gzipped. Your app should look like you, not us.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-12T03:12:40Z","updated":"2026-10-11T01:40:58Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://coffeetocoffee.github.io/barefoot-css/demo/","topics":[],"demo":"https://coffeetocoffee.github.io/barefoot-css/demo/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T06:14:58.143Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T06:14:58.143Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T06:14:58.143Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T06:14:58.143Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Kick off your boots. A bare-bones, themeable, JS-free CSS framework for people who'd rather not ship 200KB of stylesheet to render a button.","Live demos: conformance demo · layout playground · paint & paper · data story · form architecture · keyboard & a11y · resilience & coexistence · acceptance gate · theme studio"],"features":["Tiny. Core (index.css) is 3KB gzipped. Import only what you use — no 200KB bundle.","Container-aware, not viewport-aware. Tables, forms, cards, and layouts adapt to the box they're in. No media queries, no JS. Try the playground.","Themeable in minutes. Every visual is a --bf- variable. No Sass, no rebuild. Tokens ship as W3C DTCG tokens.json.","JS-free by default. Dialogs are , accordions are , menus are popovers. Opt-in zero-dependency JS only where CSS can't reach (tabs, sorting, theme persistence).","Accessible. Native semantics, visible focus, AA contrast, forced-colors support, axe-core tested in CI."],"sourceUrl"